   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-03-03 [507feea]
    -->
    <para>修复 watchdog 中的段错误。（Muhammad Usama）</para>
    <para>讨论：<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2022-March/008089.html">[pgpool-general: 8030]</ulink></para>
